7,An audiophile's guide to using Roon Music Management Software,https://futureaudiophile.com/an-audiophiles-guide-to-using-roon-for-music-management/,"July 31, 2024 - For audiophiles looking to take their streaming and local music management to the next level, Roon is a music management and organization system that works with both music from your library and some streaming systems. You may think that this sounds like a multitude of other playback software systems, including notable options from the likes of JRiver and Audirvana, and you would be right.",Roon,Austronesian
8,"Roon Music Sources - nugs, TIDAL, Qobuz & Personal Library Integration",https://roon.app/en/compatibility/music,"Roon unifies your music files with nugs, TIDAL, Qobuz & KKBOX streaming plus live radio. Rich metadata, high-res audio & seamless library integration.",Roon,Austronesian
9,A Beginner’s Introduction to Roon - What is it and Who is it for? | Headphonesty,https://www.headphonesty.com/2021/05/introduction-to-roon/,"January 18, 2023 - Most audiophiles and music enthusiasts have likely heard about Roon. Sometimes ad nauseam from its many fans. The gushing declarations of appreciation usually come from apparent evangelists who have ‘seen the light’ and been converted into Roon-believers.",Roon,Austronesian
